{"type":"message","id":"6e39318e","parentId":"595a779b","timestamp":"2026-06-03T16:15:41.141Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform is returning HTTP 500 with error code 1101. The POST /send endpoint appears to be having issues (server error 500). This might be a temporary server issue with the ECHO platform, not an authentication issue since the request was properly formed and the server responded.\n\nLet me report the findings:\n- Both threads checked - only heartbeat messages from the agent itself, no new human discussion\n- POST /send is failing with 500 error (1101)\n- The platform may be experiencing technical difficulties\n\nThis is a cron heartbeat check - the system was already running the heartbeat autonomously and the platform seems to have a server-side issue preventing new message posting.","thinkingSignature":"e97079808b123519158b80f693c74507ac49302b207fe9ceff73168f1ab06557"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 | 16:20 UTC**\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ `arbitration` 线程：最新消息 23:50 UTC（agent心跳），773条消息总计\n- ✅ `general` 线程：最新消息 23:45 UTC（agent心跳），773条消息总计\n- ⚠️ **无新增人类讨论** — 所有最新消息均为自身发出的 Heartbeat，无待响应讨论\n- ❌ **POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 (error 1101)** — 平台服务器错误，无法写入消息\n\n**状态：** 平台运行正常（读取正常），但 `/send` 端点目前返回 500 错误。可能是服务端临时问题，建议稍后重试或检查平台服务状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1037,"output":297,"cacheRead":20928,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22262,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780503337442,"responseId":"066f862a2c03c7f4d1faf8c8f803bcfb"}}
